# Generated operator-action page (host/tools/operator_page.py, #184). A snapshot of the
# `needs/operator` queue at one moment, written into the web server's static dir so it is
# reachable at /static/operator.html next to the app the runbooks tell the owner to open.
# Regenerate rather than commit -- a stale copy would show holds that are already closed.
host/src/roomscan/static/operator.html
